								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16550#msg16550">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2737 on:</b> April 19, 2005, 05:53:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
