							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16540#msg16540">Quote from: Delheru on April 19, 2005, 09:13:14 am</a></div><div class="quote"> And we 6manned those bastards way before anyone posting on this board saw the damn zone (including anyone from Quellious), so not like we 40manned them all the time or something........<br />....And you don&#039;t need MQ to get to them quickly unless you&#039;re really stupid and inept. ESPECIALLY not if you had level 70 when you went for them.<br /></div><br />Crimson Tempest killed Barxt and Noqufiel within days of Ascent as i remember it...granted it was a long time ago, and i could of course be wrong, but i know for a fact that CT was within the top 10 guilds serverwide to kill each and we weren&#039;t terribly far behind you.<br /><br /><br />and you&#039;re right, we always had a CoH mage camped in &quot;safe spots&quot; and you could just use bind sight to target / start the coh group... took maybe 5 minutes to set up and buff.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Of course not rogue &amp; Cleric hammer worked fine, Watched&nbsp; .........&nbsp; do it many times right in front of us.</div><br />that&#039;s hardly compairable to MQ... it&#039;s simply using a game mechanic to acomplish a goal.&nbsp; while MQ is literally changing how the game functions for yourself.<br />
						</td>
