	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16552"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813" title="View the profile of Justyse">Justyse</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 79<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img216.exs.cx/img216/6516/convicavat44as.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								WeEeeEeeeeeee!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/forums" title="&lt;Conviction&gt;" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tribeof3@shentel.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16552#msg16552"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16552#msg16552">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2738 on:</b> April 19, 2005, 08:04:03 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Our guild does what most other guilds do, we allowed Msha&#039;s to be killed during offtime and those members sent in DKP records and loot records which were entered the next day.<br />All we asked is that people were <span style="text-decoration: underline;">honest and responsible</span> since it took the whole guild to get them there.<br />Honestly, this rule was made MORE to protect the less &quot;elite&quot; from the more highly geared (officers included) who had more <i>capability</i> to go in and farm it with no dkp cost.<br />We felt that it would be unfair to do to our members since without them, we wouldnt be there in the first place.<br />Every single piece of our guilds Qvic gear has had a price tag and it damn well should imo.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
