							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16554#msg16554"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16554#msg16554">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2739 on:</b> April 19, 2005, 08:39:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							never said there was anything wrong with charging dkp or anything like that.<br /><br />i ment to say that i can understand how an issue such as this would cause drama, and i gave an example of how my guild did it, in a way that really didn&#039;t have any drama at all...<br /><br />to each their own, and whatever works best for you!
